function toYmd(v){ if(!v) return ''; if(/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}$/.test(v)) return v; if(/^\d{2}-\d{2}-\d{4}$/.test(v)) return dmyToYmd(v); return ''; }
function parse(y){ return parseYmd(y); }
var vals=[data.contractDate,data.prepStart,data.prepEnd,data.prodStart,data.installStart,data.installEnd,data.finalAccept];
var ymds=[]; vals.forEach(function(v){ var y=toYmd(v); if(y) ymds.push(y); });
if(!ymds.length){ box.innerHTML=''; return; }
var dates=ymds.map(parse).filter(Boolean);
if(!dates.length){ box.innerHTML=''; return; }
var min=dates[0], max=dates[0];
dates.forEach(function(d){ if(d<min) min=d; if(d>max) max=d; });
max = new Date(max.getTime()+86400000*10);
var totalMs = max-min; if(totalMs<=0) totalMs=1;
var scale = (inst_el('ia_gantt_scale') && inst_el('ia_gantt_scale').value) || (window.INST_GANTT_SCALE||'month');
if(scale!=='month') scale='month';
